of Anthos as well.

00:52:22.800 --> 00:52:28.180
So, immediately, we definitely
support GKE and GKE on-prem.

00:52:28.180 --> 00:52:30.700
That's our integration
with Anthos.

00:52:30.700 --> 00:52:34.330
And over the period of time,
we will support other features

00:52:34.330 --> 00:52:35.620
as they become GA.

00:52:35.620 --> 00:52:37.330
CSM is not GA yet.

00:52:37.330 --> 00:52:41.050
So Cloud Services management,
which is managed with Istio.

00:52:41.050 --> 00:52:43.900
When it becomes GA, we will
start integration with it

00:52:43.900 --> 00:52:44.900
as well.

